Cobb’s Free 2026 Comedy Nights (Secret Guest List)
Cobbs Comedy Club
Cobb’s Comedy Club has a secret guestlist for a handpicked group of shows at SF’s biggest comedy club.
Every month they handpick some of SF’s top local comedians to showcase for you – often with credits like SF Sketchfest, NBC, Comedy Central and more.
Secret Guest List: Cobb’s Free Comedy Nights
Cobb’s Comedy Club, 915 Columbus Ave., SF
FREE with RSVP (otherwise tickets are $18-26).
– Must RSVP no later than 1 hour before showtime
Free Comedy Shows 2026

/// Friday, September 18 – 9:30pm – “Get it?!” Gameshow
/// Sunday, September 27 – 7pm – Really Funny Comedians (Who Happen to Be Women) w/ Felicia Folkes
/// Wednesday, October 7 – 7:30pm – Cobb’s Comedy Showcase
/// Sunday, October 18 – 7pm – Drag-Up Comedy
/// Wednesday, October 21 – 7:30pm – Anthony Locascio
/// Saturday, October 31 – 8pm – A Ghostly, Ghastly Get It?! Gameshow

Like all things in life, lineups are subject to change and each show may vary. RSVP required, but admission is first come first served. Like most comedy clubs there is a two-drink minimum.

